{
  "id": "396",
  "title": "Do I Need to Wear a Suit?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-11-01",
  "synopsis": "Manager Wang needs someone to join him to participate in an opening ceremony.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/565/3c665b1d28dc92d92492e30c588698660f8ec47d.mp3?1698670387",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "要穿西服吗？\n\n王总：小张，11月1号跟我一起去参加一个开业典礼。\n小张：11月1号吗？王总，不好意思，那天我要出差。\n王总：哦，对，我想起来了。那你把小何叫进来一下。\n小张：好的。\n王总：小何，11月1号跟我一起去参加一个开业典礼。\n小何：好的。要穿西服吗？\n王总：中午有个宴会，穿吧。\n小何：好的。\n王总：这是邀请函，你拿着。\n小何：好的。王总，那没别的事，我先去忙了。\n王总：去吧。",
    "traditional": "要穿西服嗎？\n\n王總：小張，11月1號跟我一起去參加一個開業典禮。\n小張：11月1號嗎？王總，不好意思，那天我要出差。\n王總：哦，對，我想起來了。那你把小何叫進來一下。\n小張：好的。\n王總：小何，11月1號跟我一起去參加一個開業典禮。\n小何：好的。要穿西服嗎？\n王總：中午有個宴會，穿吧。\n小何：好的。\n王總：這是邀請函，你拿著。\n小何：好的。王總，那沒別的事，我先去忙了。\n王總：去吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Do I Need to Wear a Suit?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王总：小张，11月1号跟我一起去参加一个开业典礼。",
      "traditional": "王總：小張，11月1號跟我一起去參加一個開業典禮。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo zhāng 2 yuè 1 hào gēn wǒ yì qǐ qù cān jiā yí ge kāi yè diǎn lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little Zhang, join me on November 1st to go participate in an opening ceremony."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小张：11月1号吗？王总，不好意思，那天我要出差。",
      "traditional": "小張：11月1號嗎？王總，不好意思，那天我要出差。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng 2 yuè 1 hào ma wáng zǒng bù hǎo yì si nà tiān wǒ yào chū chāi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: November 1st? Manager Wang, I'm sorry. On that day I'm going on a business trip."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王总：哦，对，我想起来了。那你把小何叫进来一下。",
      "traditional": "王總：哦，對，我想起來了。那你把小何叫進來一下。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng ò duì wǒ xiǎng qǐ lái le nà nǐ bǎ xiǎo hé jiào jìn lái yí xià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Oh, right, now I remember. Then go call for Little He."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小张：好的。",
      "traditional": "小張：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王总：小何，11月1号跟我一起去参加一个开业典礼。",
      "traditional": "王總：小何，11月1號跟我一起去參加一個開業典禮。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng xiǎo hé 2 yuè 1 hào gēn wǒ yì qǐ qù cān jiā yí ge kāi yè diǎn lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Little He, join me on November 1st to go participate in an opening ceremony."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。要穿西服吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。要穿西服嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de yào chuān xī fú ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Okay. Do I need to wear a suit?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "王总：中午有个宴会，穿吧。",
      "traditional": "王總：中午有個宴會，穿吧。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng zhōng wǔ yǒu ge yàn huì chuān ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: There’s a lunch banquet, so wear a suit."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Okay."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "王总：这是邀请函，你拿着。",
      "traditional": "王總：這是邀請函，你拿著。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng zhè shì yāo qǐng hán nǐ ná zhe",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Wang: Here's the invitation letter, take it."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。王总，那没别的事，我先去忙了。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。王總，那沒別的事，我先去忙了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de wáng zǒng nà méi bié de shì wǒ xiān qù máng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Okay. Manager Wang, if there’s nothing else I’ll go back to work."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "王总：去吧。",
      "traditional": "王總：去吧。",
      "pinyin": "wáng zǒng qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Manager Wang: Go ahead."
    }
  ],
